// M8b tech demo: Blue mechanised infantry (three M2 with a squad each) reaches the village
// ahead of a Red tank and BMP attack. Play as Blue: dismount (U) short of the village, send
// the squads into houses (right click a building with the dismount platoon selected) and use
// the carriers as a fire base. Red's commander does not dismount its squads yet (TODO F11).
(
    id: "m8b-dismounts",
    name: "DISMOUNTS IN THE VILLAGE",
    date: (1985, 6, 15),
    start_time_s: 36000, // 10:00
    map: (id: "demo", recipe: "rolling-farmland", seed: 42, size_m: 8000.0),
    seed: 8,
    briefing: "SITUATION: A RED TANK PLATOON AND A BMP PLATOON ARE EXPECTED FROM THE NORTH-EAST.\n\nMISSION: 1ST MECHANISED PLATOON SEIZES AND HOLDS THE VILLAGE FOR 30 MINUTES. RED WINS BY HOLDING THE VILLAGE UNCONTESTED FOR 2 MINUTES.\n\nNOTES: DISMOUNT (U) SHORT OF THE VILLAGE, OCCUPY HOUSES WITH THE SQUADS (RIGHT CLICK A BUILDING), KEEP THE M2S BACK AS A FIRE BASE. SQUADS IN MASONRY HOUSES NEED HE TO BE CLEARED.",
    objectives: [(name: "VILLAGE", centre: (4500.0, 4300.0), radius_m: 350.0)],
    victory: (time_limit_s: 1800.0, objective: "VILLAGE", attacker: 1, destroyed_fraction: 0.75),
    sides: [
        (
            name: "BLUE",
            doctrine: "western-combined",
